%% Title: Agent orchestration flow
%% Purpose: Show how a user request moves through Design Jarvis roles.
%% Assumptions:
%% - Design Lead reviews user-visible artifacts.
%% Open questions:
%% - Confirm whether memory update is needed at the end.
flowchart TD
    User([Designer asks]) --> Orchestrator[Design Jarvis routes]
    Orchestrator --> Specialist{Which specialist?}
    Specialist -- Research --> UX[UX Researcher]
    Specialist -- Design --> Designer[Designer]
    Specialist -- Code --> FE[Front-End Engineer]
    Specialist -- Memory --> Ops[Design Ops]
    UX --> Review{User-visible artifact?}
    Designer --> Review
    FE --> Review
    Review -- Yes --> Lead[Design Lead review]
    Review -- No --> Output[Return result]
    Lead --> Approved{Approved?}
    Approved -- Yes --> Output
    Approved -- No --> Iterate[Iterate with fix list]
    Iterate --> Lead
    Output --> Memory{Save decision?}
    Memory -- Yes --> Ops
    Memory -- No --> Done([Done])
    Ops --> Done
